---
const pageTitle = "Affiliate Disclosure | SavingHarbor.com";
const pageDescription = "Learn how SavingHarbor.com earns commissions through affiliate partnerships while maintaining transparency, editorial integrity, and user trust.";
const canonicalURL = "https://savingharbor.com/affiliate-disclosure";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={pageDescription} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonicalURL} />

    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:title" content={pageTitle} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={pageDescription} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonicalURL} />

    <!-- Twitter -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={pageTitle} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={pageDescription} />

    <!-- Structured Data -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "WebPage",
        "name": "Affiliate Disclosure",
        "url": "https://savingharbor.com/affiliate-disclosure",
        "description": "Official affiliate disclosure explaining how SavingHarbor.com earns commissions and maintains editorial integrity.",
        "publisher": {
          "@type": "Organization",
          "name": "SavingHarbor.com",
          "url": "https://savingharbor.com"
        }
      }
    </script>

    <style>
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI",
          Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, "Open Sans", "Helvetica Neue",
          sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        line-height: 1.8;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 80px auto;
        padding: 0 20px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        color: #333;
      }

      a {
        color: #0f62fe;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
      }

      .last-updated {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: #666;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <main class="container">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

      <div class="last-updated">
        Last Updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString("en-US", {
          year: "numeric",
          month: "long",
          day: "numeric",
        })}
      </div>

      <p>
        SavingHarbor.com participates in affiliate marketing programs and may
        earn a commission when users click on certain links or complete
        qualifying purchases through links available on this website, at no
        additional cost to the user. When a visitor clicks an affiliate link,
        any purchase or transaction is completed directly with the respective
        merchant, and the merchant may compensate SavingHarbor.com for the
        referral. These partnerships help support the ongoing operation,
        maintenance, and improvement of the platform, allowing us to provide
        access to curated coupons, promotional offers, and savings-related
        resources free of charge.
      </p>

      <p>
        Compensation received from merchants may influence the placement,
        visibility, or positioning of certain offers on the site. However,
        such compensation does not determine our commitment to accuracy,
        transparency, or user-first standards. We aim to present relevant,
        timely, and valuable promotional information based on availability,
        merchant data, seasonal trends, and overall user experience. While we
        make reasonable efforts to ensure that listed coupons and offers are
        current, final pricing, eligibility, availability, and promotional
        terms are determined solely by the merchant and may change without
        notice.
      </p>

      <p>
        SavingHarbor.com does not directly sell, ship, manufacture, or provide
        warranties for any products or services featured on this website. All
        purchases, returns, exchanges, customer service inquiries, and product
        guarantees are handled exclusively by the respective third-party
        merchants. Users are encouraged to review the merchant’s individual
        terms and conditions, privacy policies, and return policies before
        completing any transaction. By using this website, you acknowledge and
        agree that affiliate relationships may exist and that commissions earned
        through these relationships support our ability to continue delivering
        reliable savings opportunities and informational content to our users.
      </p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
